:"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-10-18T19:49:35Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T19:19:16Z","closed_at":"2024-12-11T19:14:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nMac OS 10.14.8\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe project-wide search dialog for script contents will frequently not find files. In the main project I'm working on, it currently excludes *all* files, returning no results. In some test projects I created, it would sometimes exclude no files, sometimes only some.\n\nI have been unable to figure out what causes this. It doesn't matter whether I search the whole project in `res://` or only some subdirectory, the error can occur in both cases. I've verified that there is no .gdignore file in the folders I'm trying to search.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download the MRP below and open it in Godot.\n2. Go to the \"script\" tab.\n3. Click search > find in files\n4. Search for \"extends\" and get no results.\n5. Go to the built-in script on foo.tscn and verify that it contains the string \"extends\".\n\nAlternatively, it seems pretty easy to cause this issue from scratch. Open a new project, then create a script somewhere, and see if it shows up in the search. If it does, make some minor change like adding a new node or a new script, and repeat. In short order you'll find that one or more of the scripts is not showing up in the search results.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[search-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17440053/search-bug.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98311/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}